lingmo-qt-plugins (5.0.10+lingmo5u1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Vendor the Darkly Qt Widgets style source for platformtheme integration.
  * Keep KDE configuration, debug, window manager and decoration modules out
    of the platform theme plugin.
  * Build the vendored Widgets style by default.
  * Advertise Lingmo as the default Qt Widgets style for third-party apps.
  * Find KDE Frameworks through their distribution-provided component packages.
  * Remove the excluded widget explorer dependency from the vendored style.
  * Use Lingmo window colors and appearance accent colors in Qt palettes.
  * Use Lingmo accent colors for widget focus states and light tab bars.

 -- Lingmo OS Team <team@lingmo.org>  Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0800

