lingmo-qt-plugins (5.0.1+lingmo5u1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * platformtheme: fix build against Qt 6.11+ (Debian Testing).
    handleThemeChange(QWindow*) was removed; now takes no arguments.
    Replace per-window loop with the zero-argument overload.
  * platformtheme: remove use of deprecated Qt::Desktop window type flag.

 -- Lingmo OS Team <team@lingmo.org>  Thu, 05 Nov 2026 05:45:00 +0800

